<title>USA: BTG says to offer service to governments.</title>
<headline>BTG says to offer service to governments.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said Thursday it has an agreement to offer the Internet access services and products of UUNET Technologies Inc to federal, state and local governments.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>BTG said it will offer the services to those government agencies with which it already has contracts such as, the U.S. Department of Justice, the Environmental Protection Agency and the Treasury Department.</p>
<p>UUNET is based in Fairfax, Va.</p>
